OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist in critical condition
OL,4,Aafter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist has suffered
OL,7,Flife-threatening injuries in a crash
OL,8,Fwith a car.
OL,10,FThe collision, involving a grey Honda
OL,11,Fmotorbike and a grey Skoda, happened at
OL,12,Fthe junction of Windsor Road and
OL,13,FFifield Road, near Maidenhead,
OL,14,FBerkshire, shortly before 18:00 GMT on
OL,15,FSaturday, said Thames Valley Police.
OL,17,FThe rider of the bike, a man aged in
OL,18,Fhis 20s, sustained serious injuries and
OL,19,Fremains in hospital in a critical
OL,20,Fcondition. A man aged in his 70s, who
OL,21,Fwas driving the Skoda, was not injured.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
